### 1. Obtener todos los productos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. Obtener solo productos disponibles (stock > 0)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/available

### 3. Agregar un producto nuevo con stock
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "name": "Speak Now Tour Hoodie",
  "category": "Apparel",
  "price": 750.00,
  "stock": 14
}

### 4. Agregar un producto agotado (stock = 0)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 0,
  "name": "The Sky is Opalite Jacket",
  "category": "Outerwear",
  "price": 850.00,
  "stock": 0
}
